# Methodology + plan results

## Methodology (`.cursor/methodology/`)

- **Always read** relevant methodology docs before implementing or evaluating a
  phase (start at `.cursor/methodology/README.md`, then roadmap / evaluation /
  data / frontend as needed).
- **Do not edit** `.cursor/methodology/**` while **implementing** an execution
  plan (`.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`).
- Methodology edits are allowed **only when planning a new stage** (new plan /
  roadmap phase), and must stay consistent with measured artifacts.

## Plan slug

Derive the working plan directory name from the plan filename without the
`.plan.md` suffix, e.g. `p1_data_execution.plan.md` → `p1_data_execution`.

## Results + logs (mandatory after plan implementation)

After finishing (or hard-stopping) a plan, write a detailed report under:

```text
.cursor/results/<plan_slug>/
  RESULTS.md          # full narrative + tables + paths to artifacts
  logs/               # console logs, tee output, command transcripts
  listen_index.json   # wav paths for any inference done in the plan
```

- Directory name **must** match the plan slug.
- Numbers must cite on-disk artifacts (`out/…`, WSL paths). Do not invent values.
- Copy or symlink important JSON summaries into the results dir when useful;
  keep large audio under `out/<plan_slug>/` (see inference-wavs rule).

